            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "john"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Created sauce for meal by adding cornstarch to marinade and heating to thicken.\nAccompanied with Saffron rice and quick stir fry peppers, mushrooms, broccoli and a dash of red pepper flakes for a little spice",
